From 7bf2f1c61bf6b5018c16b559d648592604022e15 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erfan Abdi <erfangplus@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 9 Apr 2026 10:14:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] bp: Make it visible for OnDevicePersonalization

We added flatbuffers dependency in tensorflow and
that caused linker errors in packages/modules/OnDevicePersonalization.

OnDevicePersonalization (lib)
  |----> federated-compute
           |----> tensorflow
                    |----> flatbuffers (we added and need to be visible to the target)

Change-Id: I8bbf550b7d6041bc962c0ecac613cbed1ee65636
---
 Android.bp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index e715631..4529955 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -124,6 +124,7 @@ cc_library {
         "//apex_available:platform",
         "com.android.bt",
         "com.android.extservices",
+        "com.android.ondevicepersonalization",
     ],
     min_sdk_version: "30",
 }
--
2.34.1